>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Description &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">15 Nov 16 &amp; 7:06pm</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Agent claimed member keep betting on GD via Mobile then system will not allow to place bet like touch on mobile screen no response.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">18 Nov 16<br />\r\n\t\t\t2:10 PM</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">Already informed GD CS.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n", "status_id"=>"7", "priority_id"=>"3", "assigned_to_id"=>"58", "start_date"=>"2016-11-15", "due_date"=>"", "custom_field_values"=>{"8"=>["Gold Deluxe-Live Casino", ""], "3"=>["Credit-Member", ""], "23"=>["Mobile", ""], "4"=>["Others", ""], "19"=>"Member not able to place bet", "15"=>"RG6Y9ZZ383", "7"=>"N/A", "17"=>"", "16"=>""}, "notes"=>"<p>GD CS replied as below:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hi Team,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Regarding this issue about cannot placed bets in mobile, as per checked by our development team, they haven&rsquo;t encountered the said issue and currently bets can be placed normally.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Should you have additional queries regarding this matter, please don&rsquo;t hesitate to contact us.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Please see image below for the results as our development team reproduce the problem.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thank you.</p>\r\n", "private_notes"=>"0", "lock_version"=>"1"}, "issue_template"=>"", "attachments"=>{"1"=>{"filename"=>"RE Reference Number 20161118O1017 - Unable to Place bets on mobile.msg", "description"=>"", "token"=>"57.0dfb5ffae16f74e64d968e105e77f525"}}, "last_journal_id"=>"355", "commit"=>"Submit", "id"=>"106"}
