>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Description &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">15 Nov 16 &amp; 7:06pm</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Agent claimed member keep betting on GD via Mobile then system will not allow to place bet like touch on mobile screen no response.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">18 Nov 16<br />\r\n\t\t\t2:10 PM</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">Already informed GD CS.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n", "status_id"=>"5", "priority_id"=>"3", "assigned_to_id"=>"58", "start_date"=>"2016-11-15", "due_date"=>"", "custom_field_values"=>{"8"=>["Gold Deluxe-Live Casino", ""], "3"=>["Credit-Member", ""], "23"=>["Mobile", ""], "4"=>["3rd Party", ""], "19"=>"Member not able to place bet", "15"=>"RG6Y9ZZ383", "7"=>"N/A", "17"=>"", "16"=>""}, "notes"=>"<p><span style=\"color:rgb(255, 0, 0)\"><strong>I. Incident&nbsp;summary</strong></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(255, 0, 0)\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span><em>[Capped at 250 words]</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(255, 0, 0)\"><strong>II. Incident Details</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>CSD internal found&nbsp;using PC Browser (mobile emulator)&nbsp;login to new mobile version and found below&nbsp;2&nbsp;issues.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>#1&nbsp;Place bet on &quot;Player&quot; &gt; [Bets are confirmed] &gt; add chips on &quot;Player&quot; &gt; no confirmed message &gt; then place bet again on Banker &gt; show [Your Bet&nbsp;is not confirmed]&nbsp;&gt; then continue bet on Banker &gt; show [Bets are confirmed].&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Question: Since count down timer still running why will show&nbsp;[Your Bet&nbsp;is not confirmed] ?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>#2 Continue placed bet&nbsp;&gt; [Bets are confirmed] &gt;&nbsp;then&nbsp;keep add on the chips&nbsp;&gt; suddenly will get error message &gt; [Sorry, the connection is terminated. Please relaunch the Live Games].</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Question:&nbsp;[Sorry, the connection is terminated. Please relaunch the Live Games] &gt; as we know for this error mesage will show only if customer&nbsp;long time no action in GD.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>TAKE NOTE: Above issues happen table timer still on countdown. But we tried&nbsp;using Iphone 5 testing there is no&nbsp;issues like above.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Kindly refer to the attached video for clear picture.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>PENDING VINCENT OR JACKAL&nbsp;CHECK</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(255, 0, 0)\"><strong>III. Chronological Order of Events</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:500px\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Date &amp; Time (GMT+8)</strong></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Description &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">20 Nov 16, 12:45am</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>CSD internal found&nbsp;using PC Browser&nbsp;(mobile emulator)&nbsp;login to new mobile version&nbsp;and found 2&nbsp;issues.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n", "private_notes"=>"0", "lock_version"=>"4"}, "issue_template"=>"", "last_journal_id"=>"374", "commit"=>"Submit", "id"=>"106"}
